multicc.memo.md
**/multicc.memo.md
tunnel-config.json
tunnel-repair-ledger.json

# Goal 预检配置（运行时，保持本地）
goal-config.json

# 营销/推广资料仅本地保存，不上仓库（含竞品对比、KOL 清单、账号策略等敏感内容）
# 统一放进 marketing-local/；下面两条根目录规则是历史遗留的双保险
marketing-local/
# Jev demo render outputs are local deliverables, not repository source.
/jev-demo-test/demo/
PROMOTION_PLAN_v2.md
